WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.800
Outside the classroom, I like

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.440
getting involved. I led a

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.800
volunteering project to give

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.319
visibility to a homeless shelter

00:00:06.319 --> 00:00:08.760
in Madrid, co-organised an event

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.760
that raised €1,350

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.800
and co-organised my

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.400
hometown's festivities with friends

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.719
for two years.

00:00:15.719 --> 00:00:17.640
I was also invited to KPMG's

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.920
Women at the Top programmes.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.680
And when I switch off, I play

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.640
the guitar and the piano, paint,

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.600
write and play tennis, which I

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.080
started to step out of my comfort

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:27.632
zone.
